<view class="scr-head"><view class="greet">家长填写</view><view class="title">成长初评</view></view>
<scroll-view class="assessment-page" scroll-y>
  <view class="assessment-hero"><view class="assessment-desc">请依据近 2 周的日常情况选择。结果用于推荐家庭成长任务，不作医疗或心理诊断。</view></view>

  <view wx:if="{{!result}}">
    <view class="assessment-tip">共 12 题，约需 3 分钟。没有标准答案，如实选择即可。</view>
    <view class="question-card" wx:for="{{questions}}" wx:for-index="questionIndex" wx:key="index"><view class="question-title"><text>{{questionIndex + 1}}.</text>{{item.title}}</view><radio-group data-index="{{questionIndex}}" bindchange="choose"><label class="option" wx:for="{{options}}" wx:for-item="option" wx:for-index="optionIndex" wx:key="value"><radio value="{{option.value}}" checked="{{answers[questionIndex] == option.value}}" color="#5E5CE6"/><text>{{option.label}}</text></label></radio-group></view>
    <button class="assessment-submit" bindtap="submit">生成成长初评</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:else><view class="result-card"><view class="result-caption">第 {{trend.count}} 次成长评估</view><view class="result-level">{{result.levelName}}</view><view class="result-score">{{result.overall}}<text> 分</text></view><view class="result-note">{{result.levelNote}}</view><view wx:if="{{trend.previous}}" class="result-trend"><view><text>较上次评估</text><text class="trend-date">{{trend.previous.completedAt}}</text></view><text class="trend-value {{trend.overallDelta > 0 ? 'up' : trend.overallDelta < 0 ? 'down' : ''}}">{{trend.overallDelta > 0 ? '+' : ''}}{{trend.overallDelta}} 分</text></view><view class="result-dims"><view wx:for="{{trend.dimensions}}" wx:key="key" class="result-dim"><text>{{item.name}}</text><view><text>{{item.score}} 分</text><text wx:if="{{item.delta !== null}}" class="dim-delta {{item.delta > 0 ? 'up' : item.delta < 0 ? 'down' : ''}}">{{item.delta > 0 ? '+' : ''}}{{item.delta}}</text></view></view></view><view class="result-insight">优势项：{{result.strength.name}} · 可优先练习：{{result.focus.name}}</view><view class="result-disclaimer">这是家庭成长记录与目标建议，不是医疗、心理或教育诊断结果。</view><view class="result-actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="retake">重新评估</button><button class="primary" bindtap="goReport">查看成长报告</button></view></view><view class="assessment-plan"><view><view class="assessment-plan-title">一键生成重点计划</view><view>依据评分最低的 1–2 个维度，创建阶梯目标和首个打卡任务。</view></view><button class="assessment-plan-btn {{planCreated ? 'created' : ''}}" bindtap="createAssessmentPlan">{{planCreated ? '已生成' : '立即生成'}}</button></view><view class="goal-entry" bindtap="goGoals"><view><view class="goal-entry-title">查看成长目标</view><view>目标会按阶段逐步解锁，每天完成小行动。</view></view><text>›</text></view><view class="recommendation-head"><view class="recommendation-title">为孩子推荐的任务</view><text bindtap="goTaskManage">任务管理 ›</text></view><view class="recommendation-tip">根据相对需要练习的维度生成。你可以一键添加，也可以在任务管理中自行创建。</view><view class="recommendation-card" wx:for="{{recommendations}}" wx:key="id"><view><view class="recommendation-dim">{{item.dimName}}</view><view class="recommendation-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="recommendation-meta">{{item.points}} 积分 · {{item.frequency === 'daily' ? '每日重复' : '完成一次'}}</view></view><button class="recommendation-add {{addedNames[item.name] ? 'added' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="addRecommendation">{{addedNames[item.name] ? '已添加' : '添加'}}</button></view></view>
</scroll-view>
